 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Mia had already opened ninety-nine doors.",
   "tag": "[mysterious]",
   "pause": 0.38,
   "audio": "build/ep21/local_lines/line_00.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "Only one remained.",
   "tag": "[mysterious]",
   "pause": 0.38,
   "audio": "build/ep21/local_lines/line_01.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "But when she reached the end of the hallway, there were two.",
   "tag": "[mysterious]",
   "pause": 0.6,
   "audio": "build/ep21/local_lines/line_02.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "Door 100.",
   "speak": "Door one hundred.",
   "tag": "[mysterious]",
   "pause": 0.38,
   "audio": "build/ep21/local_lines/line_03.wav",
   "local": {
    "src": "en_us_007"
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "And a smaller door labeled 000.",
   "speak": "And a smaller door labeled zero zero zero.",
   "tag": "[mysterious]",
   "pause": 0.38,
   "audio": "build/ep21/local_lines/line_04.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "The second door wasn't on the map.",
   "tag": "[mysterious]",
   "pause": 0.38,
   "audio": "build/ep21/local_lines/line_05.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "Mia tried to ignore it.",
   "tag": "[conversational]",
   "pause": 0.38,
   "audio": "build/ep21/local_lines/line_06.wav",
   "local": {
    "src": "en_us_006"
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "Then she heard someone crying behind it.",
   "tag": "[whispers]",
   "pause": 0.38,
   "audio": "build/ep21/local_lines/line_07.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Please don't leave me here.\"",
   "speak": "Please don't leave me here.",
   "voice": "boy",
   "tag": "[crying]",
   "pause": 0.6,
   "audio": "build/ep21/local_lines/line_08.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "She opened the smaller door.",
   "tag": "[mysterious]",
   "pause": 0.38,
   "audio": "build/ep21/local_lines/line_09.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "Inside was a tiny hotel room.",
   "tag": "[mysterious]",
   "pause": 0.38,
   "audio": "build/ep21/local_lines/line_10.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "A Roblox character sat alone on the floor.",
   "tag": "[mysterious]",
   "pause": 0.38,
   "audio": "build/ep21/local_lines/line_11.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "It was a little boy holding a flashlight.",
   "tag": "[softly]",
   "pause": 0.38,
   "audio": "build/ep21/local_lines/line_12.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "He looked up and asked,",
   "tag": "[softly]",
   "pause": 0.38,
   "audio": "build/ep21/local_lines/line_13.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Did you find the exit?\"",
   "speak": "Did you find the exit?",
   "voice": "boy",
   "tag": "[softly]",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "audio": "build/ep21/local_lines/line_14.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "Mia nodded.",
   "tag": "[softly]",
   "pause": 0.38,
   "audio": "build/ep21/local_lines/line_15.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "The boy smiled.",
   "tag": "[softly]",
   "pause": 0.55,
   "audio": "build/ep21/local_lines/line_16.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "Then every light in the hotel turned green.",
   "tag": "[mysterious]",
   "pause": 0.38,
   "audio": "build/ep21/local_lines/line_17.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "A notification appeared.",
   "tag": "[mysterious]",
   "pause": 0.38,
   "audio": "build/ep21/local_lines/line_18.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"LOST PLAYER RECOVERED.\"",
   "speak": "Lost player recovered.",
   "voice": "system",
   "fx": "giant",
   "tag": "[slowly, deep]",
   "pause": 0.6,
   "audio": "build/ep21/local_lines/line_19.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "Suddenly, the hotel began collapsing.",
   "tag": "[urgent]",
   "pause": 0.38,
   "audio": "build/ep21/local_lines/line_20.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "Mia grabbed the boy's hand and ran.",
   "tag": "[urgent]",
   "pause": 0.38,
   "audio": "build/ep21/local_lines/line_21.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "They reached Door 100 just as the ceiling fell.",
   "speak": "They reached Door one hundred just as the ceiling fell.",
   "tag": "[urgent]",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "audio": "build/ep21/local_lines/line_22.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "Outside was a bright morning sky.",
   "tag": "[in awe]",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "audio": "build/ep21/local_lines/line_23.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "And for the first time, the boy's username appeared.",
   "tag": "[mysterious]",
   "pause": 0.8,
   "audio": "build/ep21/local_lines/line_24.wav",
   "local": {
    "src": "en_us_010"
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "It was the name of a player who'd disappeared five years ago.",
   "tag": "[mysterious]",
   "pause": 0.38,
   "audio": "build/ep21/local_lines/line_25.wav",
   "local": {
    "src": "en_us_010"
   }
  }
 ],
